abstract: "A provenance evaluation protocol for testing whether the initiating human and initiating event of a specified human–AI trajectory can be identified reliably and whether that attribution is robust across reasonable alternative trajectory-boundary rules. The protocol does not test special causal force, AI continuity, personhood, consciousness, or authority arising from Origin-status."

